IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `da-claims`

-- Defamation Act 2005 (WA) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_defamation-act-2005_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-daniel): Daniel, 44, standing for the House of
-- Representatives in June 2040, finds a false post about his company, Jarrah Legal Technologies Pty Ltd; a concerns notice;
-- an offer of amends accepted (d062). Jarrah's 2040 headcount (40 full-time equivalents), the 10 days from notice to offer,
-- the offer's contents and the damages figures are illustrative.

